abstract: >
  R-ODAF-Shiny is an interactive R Shiny application implementing the
  downstream RNA-Seq differential-expression component of the R-ODAF framework.
  The application applies predefined analytical criteria and provides
  quality-control visualizations, differential-expression exploration,
  standardized outputs, within-session result comparison, and optional pathway
  enrichment. The validated production software environment is defined through
  a version-pinned Docker configuration.

